; Reason: npm does NOT inherit .npmrc from a parent directory - it stops at the nearest
; package.json - so the root copy does not cover this sub-project and it needs its own.
;
; Without these, `npm install` here stalls for MINUTES fetching advisory and funding
; metadata even when every package is already up to date, because npmjs is retiring the
; endpoint npm uses for it ("npm notice This endpoint is being retired"). Measured 4 Sep
; 2026 with no dependency changes at all: 6-7 minutes per sub-project.
;
; `npm audit` still works. This only stops the implicit call on every install.
audit=false
fund=false